Item 100 to 149 check Helm
    Events
        Unit - A unit Acquires an item
    Conditions
        (Item level of (Item being manipulated)) Greater than or equal to 100
        (Item level of (Item being manipulated)) Less than or equal to 149
        (Unit-type of (Hero manipulating item)) Not equal to Bag
        (Unit-type of (Hero manipulating item)) Not equal to Stash
    Actions
        Set VariableSet IDS_Level = (Item level of (Item being manipulated))
        Set VariableSet IDS_Unit = (Triggering unit)
        Set VariableSet IDS_Size = (Size of inventory for IDS_Unit)
        -------- -------- Setting value of Item from random to 0 -------- --------
        Set VariableSet IDS_Item = 0
        For each (Integer IDS_LoopInteger) from 1 to IDS_Size, do (Actions)
            Loop - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        (Item level of (Item carried by IDS_Unit in slot IDS_LoopInteger)) Greater than or equal to 100
                        (Item level of (Item carried by IDS_Unit in slot IDS_LoopInteger)) Less than or equal to 149
                    Then - Actions
                        Set VariableSet IDS_Item = (IDS_Item + 1)
                        -------- -------- It will increase to 1 if hero have 1 item level 1, to 2 if hero have 2 items level 1... -------- --------
                    Else - Actions
        -------- How many items of item Level allowed --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                IDS_Item Greater than 1
            Then - Actions
                Set VariableSet tmp_point = (Position of (Triggering unit))
                -------- -------- Move the item, and the hero will lose it. -------- --------
                Item - Move (Item being manipulated) to tmp_point
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        EasyItem_SystemActive Equal to False
                    Then - Actions
                        -------- -------- Warn player -------- --------
                        Custom script:   call DisplayTextToPlayer(GetOwningPlayer(GetTriggerUnit()), 0, 0, "|cffffcc00WARNING:|r You cannot carry more than 1 of this item.")
                        -------- ================ --------
                        -------- CHAT --------
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                (Triggering unit) Equal to Nazgrek
                            Then - Actions
                                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from Nazgrek named Nazgrek: Play Nazgrek_ItemErrorAny <gen> and display I’m already weari....  Modify duration: Set to 2.25 seconds and Don't wait
                            Else - Actions
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                (Triggering unit) Equal to Zulkis
                            Then - Actions
                                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from Zulkis named Zul'kis: Play Zulkis_ItemErrorAny <gen> and display I’m already weari....  Modify duration: Set to 2.00 seconds and Don't wait
                            Else - Actions
                        -------- ================ --------
                    Else - Actions
                -------- -------- Get rid of leaks -------- --------
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_tmp_point)
            Else - Actions
        Set VariableSet IDS_Unit = No unit
